{title: Holy Spirit (FJ_7_en)}
{song_number: 7}
{language: en}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[G]There's nothing worth more that will ever come close.
[Cmaj7]No thing can compare; You're our living hope.
[G]Your Presence, [Cmaj7]Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Holy Spirit, You are welcome here.
[Cmaj7]Come flood this place and fill the [Am7]atmosphere.
[G]Your glory, God, is what our hearts long for,
[Cmaj7]to be overcome by Your [Am7]Presence, Lord,
[Cmaj7]Your [Am7]Presence, Lord.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[G]I've tasted and seen of the sweetest of loves,
[Cmaj7]where my heart becomes free and my shame is undone,
[G]in Your Presence, [Cmaj7]Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Holy Spirit, You are welcome here.
[Cmaj7]Come flood this place and fill the [Am7]atmosphere.
[G]Your glory, God, is what our hearts long for,
[Cmaj7]to be overcome by Your [Am7]Presence, Lord,
[Cmaj7]Your [Am7]Presence, Lord.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[G]Let us become more aware of Your Presence.
Let us experience the glory of Your goodness.
[Cmaj7]Let us become more aware of Your [G/B]Presence.
[Am7]Let us experience the glory of Your [G/B]goodness.
{end_of_bridge}
